+msgstr ""
+
+#: addons/skin.estuary/xml/Variables.xml
+#. Hades, player information, the speakers: the device that the PC is connected through (a sound bar, a receiver, a switch), before the name of the display it passes on (SpeakerPlan.h)
+msgctxt "#54962"
