+ * the EDID cannot tell which. An EDID without that address (DisplayPort, an ELD) says nothing of it.
+ * None of these blocks says which speakers the device really has: a speaker allocation is what it
+ * accepts; only a Room Configuration or Speaker Location Data Block (CTA-861-G) says the room.
  *
  * Kodi's channels name a 5.1 surround pair BL/BR or SL/SR as its decoder has them: on the plan both
